{"version":1,"content":"<p>美國西北大學物理學家團隊近日在粒子物理實驗領域取得重大突破，首次將電子的反物質對應粒子——正電子，成功引導並穩定控制在精確的量子態下，且在近乎絕對零度的極端真空環境中懸浮囚禁長達數月。這項發表於《物理評論快報》（Physical Review Letters）的研究成果構建了全球首個「單正電子量子回旋加速器」，為人類探索宇宙物質留存之謎開闢了全新實驗路徑。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1586210.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:16:58.073443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:03:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:10:17.187777+00:00","content_hash":"25e7203d38b04de9e719074c733af57e9b8a5643dbb1f196bb9ca1a7432574f5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}